From 133a5035c9d18ebf0acd7ce68d3b46525b9664c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ebatyvor-ctrl <ebatyvor@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:46:02 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Port renderer init to Vulkan 1.1 (classic render pass path)

- Force DYNAMIC_RENDERING=false; require only VK_KHR_swapchain
- Use VK_API_VERSION_1_1 for instance, device, VMA and shaderc target env
- Replace VkPhysicalDeviceVulkan11/12Features with VkPhysicalDeviceShaderDrawParametersFeatures
- Fix pNext chains in DeviceManager and Device
- Use VK11.vkGetPhysicalDeviceProperties2
- Enable VK_EXT_sampler_filter_minmax only when present
- GraphicsPipeline: fall back to the builder's render pass when PipelineState has none

---
 src/main/java/net/vulkanmod/vulkan/Vulkan.java                 | 17 +++++----
 src/main/java/net/vulkanmod/vulkan/device/Device.java          | 36 ++++++++++---------
 src/main/java/net/vulkanmod/vulkan/device/DeviceManager.java   | 33 ++++++++---------
 src/main/java/net/vulkanmod/vulkan/shader/GraphicsPipeline.java| 13 ++++++-
 src/main/java/net/vulkanmod/vulkan/shader/SpirvCompiler.java   |  4 +--
 src/main/java/net/vulkanmod/vulkan/texture/SamplerManager.java |  6 ++--
 6 files changed, 65 insertions(+), 44 deletions(-)

